        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion A5, Solid Brass Ketme Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ketme Deadbolt is from Fusion hardware's Elite Collection, which features concealed mounting screws. It is the perfect blend of old and new, with a modern shape that brings in traditional elements for a very chic look. This Grade 2 deadbolt is available in both single and double cylinder functions. The A5 Deadbolt is available in 5 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion A5 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elite Collection Ketme Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ketme Deadbolt, Fusion A5",
                "description": "Fusion A5, Ketme Deadbolt - The Ketme Deadbolt is from Fusion hardware's Elite Collection, which features concealed mounting screws. It is the perfect blend of old and new, with a modern shape that brings in traditional elements for a very chic look. This Grade 2 deadbolt is available in both single and double cylinder functions. The A5 Deadbolt is available in 5 finishes.",
                "keywords": "FUS-A5, Fusion A5, Ketme Deadbolts, Elite Collection Ketme Deadbolts,  fusion hardware simple A5-0 deadbolts, grade 2 deadbolts, fusion hardware A5 deadbolts, fusion 100-A5, fusion 200-A5, fus-A5-0, fusion A5-0 rose deadbolts, single cylinder deadbolts, double cylinder deadbolts, modern deadbolts, contemporary deadbolts, modern door locks, Solid Brass Ketme Deadbolts,"
